<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Byllis</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bullis</span></b> ,
			ĭdis, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βυλλίς</span> Steph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βουλλίς</span> Ptol., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Grecian Illyria</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				3, 40</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Phil. 11, 11,
			26</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bullĭdenses</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				3, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 40</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bullien-ses</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Cic. Pis.
				40, 96</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bulliōnes</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam.
				13, 42, 1</span></i> (others, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bullĭdenses</span></b> ).— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bulĭōnes</span></b> ,
				um, m., <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 23,
				26, § 145</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>E. .</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Bullīni</span></b> , <i>the inhabitants of Byllis</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 44,
				30, 10</span></i>.</div>
